# Videorganizer

Local video organizer: Go server + embedded static UI. Markers stored in filenames.

## Direction

Check `.cursor/tasks/` for the backlog. Each task is a markdown file with `title` and `status` frontmatter (`upcoming`, `backlog`, `done`).

Always create a new task when starting a new feature.

## Constraints

- `static/` is embedded in the binary — no tests, build artifacts, or dev-only files there
- Dev/test scripts live under `scripts/`
- Prefer minimal diffs; match existing code style

## Timestamps (current)

- Suffix format: `-ts_{default}[_a_{audio}]` in centiseconds (delta within each block). Key `t` = default; key `a` = audio.
- Split markers and legacy `__ts_` migration are out of scope unless a task says otherwise
